        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"387244\">Yaël Dillies</span> <a href=\"#narrow/channel/113489-new-members/topic/More.20lemmas.20for.20List.2ETFAE/near/606422696\">said</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Don't use <code>concat</code>, use <code>++ [_]</code> instead</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Is this a convention? Is there a particular reason behind this?</p>",
